00:20:34,330 --> 00:22:36,500
A breakthrough in cultivation is when a character levels up and overcomes their current bottleneck in cultivation. Breakthroughs are always important moments because they mean an increase in power.
Cultivation realms for Qi Condensation are segmented into layers numbered from 1 to 15.
Later cultivation realms are segmented between early stage, middle stage, late stage and peak late stage.
Whether it's going from a sub-level to another one or advancing to the next realm of cultivation, it always involves a breakthrough.

A LOT of stuff is getting cut & rewritten here, I won't go over all of it because there is just too much and most of it won't have too many consequences. Just know that novel Wang Lin doesn't go from layer 1 to layer 14 in one go but has to work for it.

